{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destiny is Calling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leo Pujols will meet resistance from locals of the crossroads neighborhood that is the historic Las Nalgas as he answers the call to open a butt tattoo parlor right in the town center. Amidst a looming council election and Arts &amp; Culture Festival\u2014not to mention the unsolved mystery of a recent attack\u2014guide Leo Pujols' hand as he creates posterior art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575970/extras/28a8de4d1203385319508834143b3897.poster.avif?t=1756255936\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575970/extras/28a8de4d1203385319508834143b3897.webm?t=1756255936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw on Butt Cheeks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with a rich and at times humorous story to unfold, you will also take hold of Leo's tattoo machine and draw on the butt cheeks of over a dozen residents of Las Nalgas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575970/extras/f095e7adf21ab1799037e5a98a88c545.poster.avif?t=1756255936\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575970/extras/f095e7adf21ab1799037e5a98a88c545.webm?t=1756255936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575970/extras/f095e7adf21ab1799037e5a98a88c545.mp4?t=1756255936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a visual novel where choices change the outcome of the story. Your drawing ability, however, does not. You heard it folks: if you don't know how to draw, no worries!  You might prefer to stamp on one of Leo's pre-made tattoos instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Leo's True Future</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the afternoons, get ready to enjoy some free time in Las Nalgas. Visit the library, attend a town council rally, browse the web, or maybe just appreciate the artwork you've brought into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575970/extras/d26c1883c49d1fed12f64c77459d0493.poster.avif?t=1756255936\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575970/extras/d26c1883c49d1fed12f64c77459d0493.webm?t=1756255936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575970/extras/d26c1883c49d1fed12f64c77459d0493.mp4?t=1756255936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to figure out how best to spend Leo's time in order to overcome obstacles and reach the ending Leo deserves.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575970?t=1756255936","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575970?t=1756255936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575970/58bf11c923e5072ad3e75e344edd37442ad6b13a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756255936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575970/58bf11c923e5072ad3e75e344edd37442ad6b13a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756255936","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family S